# Public origin of the site, e.g. https://cupy.coffee  (no trailing slash needed)
# Used for canonical URLs, Open Graph / Twitter image URLs, sitemap.xml and robots.txt.
#
# Optional on Vercel: when unset, the build falls back to VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL
# (the production domain assigned in the Vercel dashboard) and then to VERCEL_URL.
# Set it explicitly once the final custom domain is known.
SITE_URL=
